[F] Where did Robinson [D7] Crusoe go
With [G7] Friday on Saturday night?
One fine [C7] Saturday night they had nothing to do
[G7] So they started counting all the [C7] girlies they [Caug7] knew
[D7] Friday counted thirteen, but Crusoe said "Brother
You know [G7] thirteen's unlucky. Let's [C7] go get a- [Caug7] nother."
So, [F] where did Robinson [D7] Crusoe go
with [G7] Friday on [C7] Saturday [F] night? [D7]

with [G7] Friday on [C7] Saturday [F] night?

